{
  "_about": "Read by build_docs.py. 'clips' puts tutorial clips into the guide and the Writing a Tutorial page. Each entry: 'section' is a heading id on that page; 'after' (optional) is the start of a paragraph, list or list item in that section to put the clips after - left out, they go at the end of the section, before its next heading. A clip is 'tutorial_folder/clip_file_without_extension'. The build stops with a message if a section, text or clip is not found, so a renamed heading or clip shows up at once.",

  "pro_only": {
    "_about": "Paragraphs or list items that start with one of these get a Pro badge. The guide and TUTORIALS.md describe Kneady Free; add here anything that is Pro-only.",
    "guide": [],
    "writing": ["Kneady Pro adds tools"]
  },

